{"content":[{"id":"70b9ed5d","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"e9c77b7","settings":{"editor":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"nl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Ontspanningsmassage Amsterdam | Stressverlichting | Mari Gomes<\/title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link href=\"https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&family=Nunito+Sans:wght@300;400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  :root { --sand: #F0EAE0; --linen: #FAF7F3; --deep: #2A2420; --muted: #7A7068; --moss: #5C6B55; --moss-light: #8CA882; --terracotta: #B5644A; --border: rgba(42,36,32,0.09); }\n  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }\n  body { font-family: 'Nunito Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--linen); color: var(--deep); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: hidden; }\n  nav { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100; padding: 18px 48px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; background: rgba(250,247,243,0.94); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border); }\n  .logo { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--deep); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }\n  .logo span { color: var(--moss); }\n  .nav-cta { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--linen); background: var(--moss); text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 24px; transition: background 0.3s; }\n  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--deep); }\n  .gtranslate_wrapper { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }\n  .gtranslate_wrapper img { display: block; border-radius: 2px; }\n  .nav-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 40px; }\n  .nav-menu { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; }\n  .nav-menu a { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s ease; }\n  .nav-menu a:hover { color: var(--moss); }\n  .nav-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; }\n  .hero { min-height: 100vh; padding: 112px 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .hero-top { flex: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center; }\n  .hero-left { padding: 64px 64px 64px 48px; }\n  .hero-tag { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: rgba(92,107,85,0.1); border: 0.5px solid rgba(92,107,85,0.3); padding: 6px 14px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--moss); margin-bottom: 28px; }\n  .hero-headline { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 54px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.2; color: var(--deep); margin-bottom: 24px; }\n  .hero-headline em { font-style: italic; color: var(--moss); }\n  .hero-sub { font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 400px; margin-bottom: 36px; line-height: 1.8; }\n  .hero-cta-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; }\n  .btn-moss { display: inline-block; background: var(--moss); color: var(--linen); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 15px 32px; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.3s; }\n  .btn-moss:hover { background: var(--deep); }\n  .btn-outline { display: inline-block; background: transparent; color: var(--moss); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 14px 30px; border: 1.5px solid var(--moss); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s; }\n  .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--moss); color: var(--linen); }\n  .location { background: var(--linen); }\n  .location-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .location-address { font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 28px; }\n  .location-map { aspect-ratio: 4\/3; overflow: hidden; border: 0.5px solid var(--border); }\n  .location-map iframe { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }\n  .hero-cta-note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }\n  .hero-right { background: var(--sand); height: 100%; min-height: 460px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 48px; }\n  .hero-visual { width: 100%; max-width: 380px; background: var(--linen); padding: 32px; border: 0.5px solid var(--border); }\n  .hero-visual-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }\n  .benefit-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border); }\n  .benefit-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n  .benefit-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--moss); flex-shrink: 0; }\n  .benefit-text { font-size: 14px; color: var(--deep); }\n  .benefit-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }\n  .strip { background: var(--moss); color: var(--linen); padding: 20px 48px; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 64px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .strip-item { font-size: 13px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }\n  .strip-item::before { content: '\u2713'; font-weight: 600; }\n  section { padding: 88px 48px; scroll-margin-top: 90px; }\n  .label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--moss); margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(30px, 3.5vw, 44px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n  .title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--moss); }\n  .how { background: var(--linen); }\n  .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 32px; margin-top: 56px; position: relative; }\n  .steps::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 24px; left: 12%; right: 12%; height: 0.5px; background: var(--border); z-index: 0; }\n  .step { position: relative; z-index: 1; text-align: center; }\n  .step-circle { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--linen); border: 1.5px solid var(--moss); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 20px; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--moss); }\n  .step-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .step-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }\n  .sessions { background: var(--sand); }\n  .session-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 48px; }\n  .session-card { background: var(--linen); padding: 36px; border: 0.5px solid var(--border); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n  .session-card::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 4px; height: 100%; background: var(--moss); }\n  .session-card h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .session-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .session-for { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--moss); }\n  .about { background: var(--deep); color: var(--linen); }\n  .about .label { color: var(--moss-light); }\n  .about .title { color: var(--linen); }\n  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 72px; align-items: center; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .about-portrait { aspect-ratio: 3\/4; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }\n  .about-content p { font-size: 15px; color: rgba(250,247,243,0.72); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  .about-content p strong { color: var(--linen); font-weight: 400; }\n  .about-sig { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 26px; font-style: italic; color: var(--linen); margin-top: 28px; }\n  .testimonials { background: var(--linen); }\n  .testi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin-top: 48px; }\n  .testi-card { background: var(--sand); padding: 28px; border: 0.5px solid var(--border); }\n  .testi-stars { color: var(--terracotta); letter-spacing: 3px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .testi-quote { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--deep); margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  .testi-by { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }\n  .faq { background: var(--sand); }\n  .faq-inner { max-width: 680px; margin: 48px auto 0; }\n  .faq-item { border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border); padding: 22px 0; }\n  .faq-q { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 18px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; color: var(--deep); }\n  .faq-q span { color: var(--moss); font-size: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; transition: transform 0.3s; }\n  .faq-a { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; padding-top: 14px; display: none; }\n  .faq-item.open .faq-a { display: block; }\n  .faq-item.open .faq-q span { transform: rotate(45deg); }\n  .cta-final { background: var(--moss); color: var(--linen); text-align: center; padding: 88px 48px; }\n  .cta-final .label { color: rgba(250,247,243,0.6); }\n  .cta-final .title { color: var(--linen); margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .cta-final p { font-size: 15px; color: rgba(250,247,243,0.75); max-width: 460px; margin: 0 auto 36px; line-height: 1.8; }\n  .btn-white { display: inline-block; background: var(--linen); color: var(--moss); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 15px 36px; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s; }\n  .btn-white:hover { background: var(--deep); color: var(--linen); }\n  .cta-note { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(250,247,243,0.5); margin-top: 16px; }\n  footer { background: var(--deep); color: rgba(250,247,243,0.5); padding: 36px 48px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; }\n  footer a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; }\n  footer .logo { color: var(--linen); }\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    nav { padding: 16px 24px; }\n    .nav-menu { display: none; }\n    .hero-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .hero-left { padding: 48px 24px; }\n    .hero-right { min-height: auto; padding: 32px 24px; }\n    section { padding: 56px 24px; }\n    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n    .steps::before { display: none; }\n    .session-grid, .testi-grid, .location-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .about-portrait { display: none; }\n    .strip { gap: 16px; padding: 16px 24px; flex-direction: column; }\n    footer { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; padding: 28px 24px; }\n  }\n  @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n  .hero-tag { opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease 0.1s forwards; }\n  .hero-headline { opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease 0.25s forwards; }\n  .hero-sub { opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease 0.4s forwards; }\n  .hero-cta-group { opacity: 0; animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease 0.55s forwards; }\n<\/style>\n<\/head>\n<body>\n\n<nav>\n  <div class=\"nav-left\">\n    <a href=\"https:\/\/amarigomes.com\" class=\"logo\">Mari <span>Gomes<\/span><\/a>\n    <div class=\"nav-menu\">\n      <a href=\"#sessions\">Sessies<\/a>\n      <a href=\"#about\">Over mij<\/a>\n      <a href=\"#testimonials\">Reviews<\/a>\n      <a href=\"#faq\">Vragen<\/a>\n      <a href=\"#location\">Locatie<\/a>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"nav-right\">\n    <div class=\"gtranslate_wrapper\" id=\"gt-wrapper-74519283\"><\/div>\n    <script>\n      window.gtranslateSettings = window.gtranslateSettings || {};\n      window.gtranslateSettings['74519283'] = {\"default_language\":\"nl\",\"languages\":[\"nl\",\"en\",\"fr\",\"pt\",\"es\"],\"url_structure\":\"none\",\"flag_style\":\"2d\",\"flag_size\":24,\"wrapper_selector\":\"#gt-wrapper-74519283\",\"alt_flags\":[],\"horizontal_position\":\"inline\",\"flags_location\":\"https:\/\/amarigomes.com\/wp-content\/plugins\/gtranslate\/flags\/\"}\n    <\/script>\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/amarigomes.com\/wp-content\/plugins\/gtranslate\/js\/flags.js?ver=7.0\" data-gt-widget-id=\"74519283\"><\/script>\n    <a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/31634366008?text=Hoi%20Mari!%20Ik%20ben%20ge%C3%AFnteresseerd%20in%20een%20ontspanningsmassage.%20Kun%20je%20me%20meer%20informatie%20sturen?\" class=\"nav-cta\" target=\"_blank\">Sessie boeken<\/a>\n  <\/div>\n<\/nav>\n\n<div class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-top\">\n    <div class=\"hero-left\">\n      <div class=\"hero-tag\">Ontspanningsmassage \u00b7 Amsterdam<\/div>\n      <h1 class=\"hero-headline\">\n        Diepe ontspanning.<br>\n        Stress losgelaten.<br>\n        <em>Lichaam hersteld.<\/em>\n      <\/h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-sub\">Draag je stress in je schouders, borst of kaak? Een full-body sessie in onze Amsterdamse studio laat spanning los waar die zit \u2014 fysiek \u00e9n energetisch.<\/p>\n      <div class=\"hero-cta-group\">\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/31634366008?text=Hoi%20Mari!%20Ik%20ben%20ge%C3%AFnteresseerd%20in%20een%20ontspanningsmassage.%20Kun%20je%20me%20een%20offerte%20en%20beschikbaarheid%20sturen?\" class=\"btn-moss\" target=\"_blank\">Vraag je offerte aan \u2192<\/a>\n        <p class=\"hero-cta-note\">Studiosessies in Amsterdam \u00b7 Offerte via WhatsApp \u00b7 Op afspraak<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"hero-right\" style=\"padding:0;\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-height:220px;overflow:hidden;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/amarigomes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/LP2_Hero.webp\" alt=\"Cli\u00ebnt ontvangt een ontspanningsmassage in de studio van Mari Gomes in Amsterdam\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;\"><\/div>\n    <div class=\"hero-visual\" style=\"border-top:none;\">\n        <p class=\"hero-visual-title\">Wat deze sessie voor jou doet<\/p>\n        <div class=\"benefit-row\"><div class=\"benefit-dot\"><\/div><div><div class=\"benefit-text\">Laat fysieke spanning los<\/div><div class=\"benefit-sub\">nek, schouders, rug, kaak<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-row\"><div class=\"benefit-dot\"><\/div><div><div class=\"benefit-text\">Vermindert stress en angst<\/div><div class=\"benefit-sub\">kalmeert het zenuwstelsel op natuurlijke wijze<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-row\"><div class=\"benefit-dot\"><\/div><div><div class=\"benefit-text\">Bevordert diepe slaap<\/div><div class=\"benefit-sub\">reset slaappatronen al vanaf de eerste sessie<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-row\"><div class=\"benefit-dot\"><\/div><div><div class=\"benefit-text\">Herstelt mentale helderheid<\/div><div class=\"benefit-sub\">weg met de mist, terug met de focus<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-row\"><div class=\"benefit-dot\"><\/div><div><div class=\"benefit-text\">Volledige holistische aanpak<\/div><div class=\"benefit-sub\">niet alleen spieren \u2014 je hele systeem<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"strip\">\n  <span class=\"strip-item\">Priv\u00e9 studio in Amsterdam<\/span>\n  <span class=\"strip-item\">Persoonlijke en professionele aanpak<\/span>\n  <span class=\"strip-item\">Op afspraak<\/span>\n  <span class=\"strip-item\">5-sterren beoordeeld<\/span>\n<\/div>\n\n<section class=\"how\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div class=\"label\">Hoe het werkt<\/div>\n    <h2 class=\"title\">Van eerste contact tot<br><em>diepe herstelling<\/em><\/h2>\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-circle\">1<\/div><div class=\"step-title\">Stuur een bericht<\/div><p class=\"step-desc\">Neem contact op via WhatsApp. Vertel wat je zoekt en ontvang snel een persoonlijke offerte.<\/p><\/div>\n      <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-circle\">2<\/div><div class=\"step-title\">Kies je sessie<\/div><p class=\"step-desc\">Samen kies je het beste sessietype en de duur die bij jouw behoeften passen \u2014 van een gerichte 60 min tot een uitgebreide 2-uur sessie.<\/p><\/div>\n      <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-circle\">3<\/div><div class=\"step-title\">Kom naar de studio<\/div><p class=\"step-desc\">Je arriveert in een priv\u00e9 studio in Amsterdam, ontworpen voor volledige ontspanning vanaf het moment dat je binnenkomt.<\/p><\/div>\n      <div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-circle\">4<\/div><div class=\"step-title\">Vertrek hersteld<\/div><p class=\"step-desc\">Je vertrekt lichter, rustiger en helderder. De meeste cli\u00ebnten voelen het verschil direct \u2014 lichaam en geest zijn gereset.<\/p><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section class=\"sessions\" id=\"sessions\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div class=\"label\">Sessieopties<\/div>\n    <h2 class=\"title\">Kies de <em>juiste diepte<\/em> voor jou<\/h2>\n    <div class=\"session-grid\">\n      <div class=\"session-card\">\n        <h3>Ontspannings- & Holistische Massage<\/h3>\n        <p>Een full-body massage die diepe fysieke ontspanning combineert met een holistische energiebenadering. Verlicht opgebouwde spierspanning en herstelt algeheel welzijn. Ideaal voor wie volledig wil loskoppelen.<\/p>\n        <p class=\"session-for\">Beste voor \u2192 chronische stress \u00b7 spierspanning \u00b7 mentale vermoeidheid<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"session-card\">\n        <h3>Energetische Helingsmassage<\/h3>\n        <p>Gaat verder dan fysieke verlichting. Deze sessie pakt de energetische oorzaak van je spanning aan \u2014 lost emotionele blokkades op, herstelt energiestroom en laat je achter met een diep gevoel van vernieuwing.<\/p>\n        <p class=\"session-for\">Beste voor \u2192 burnout \u00b7 angst \u00b7 gevoel van loskoppeling<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section class=\"about\" id=\"about\">\n  <div class=\"about-grid\">\n    <div class=\"about-portrait\" style=\"background:transparent;overflow:hidden;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/amarigomes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/LP1_About.webp\" alt=\"Interieur van de priv\u00e9 massagestudio van Mari Gomes in Amsterdam\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;\"><\/div>\n    <div class=\"about-content\">\n      <div class=\"label\">Jouw therapeut<\/div>\n      <h2 class=\"title\">Techniek, <em>sensitiviteit<\/em> en diepte<\/h2>\n      <p>Mari Gomes is specialist in energiemassage en holistische lichaamstherapie\u00ebn. Met uitgebreide ervaring combineert ze <strong>nauwkeurige techniek met echte sensitiviteit<\/strong> \u2014 elke sessie wordt afgestemd op wat jij die dag meebrengt.<\/p>\n      <p>Haar methode wordt erkend om precisie en diepte. Ze werkt met het lichaam als geheel \u2014 fysiek, emotioneel en energetisch \u2014 omdat echte ontspanning betekent: spanning op elk niveau loslaten.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>Alle sessies vinden plaats in een priv\u00e9 studio in Amsterdam.<\/strong> De ruimte is ontworpen om diep werk te ondersteunen vanaf het moment dat je aankomt.<\/p>\n      <div class=\"about-sig\">Mari Gomes<\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section class=\"testimonials\" id=\"testimonials\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div class=\"label\">Ervaringen van cli\u00ebnten<\/div>\n    <h2 class=\"title\">Ze kwamen gestrest.<br><em>Ze vertrokken getransformeerd.<\/em><\/h2>\n    <div class=\"testi-grid\">\n      <div class=\"testi-card\">\n        <div class=\"testi-stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<\/div>\n        <p class=\"testi-quote\">\"Ze is zeer attent en helpt je echt uitrusten en opladen. Sterk aanbevolen \u2014 een geweldige ervaring van begin tot eind.\"<\/p>\n        <p class=\"testi-by\">Jonas<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"testi-card\">\n        <div class=\"testi-stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<\/div>\n        <p class=\"testi-quote\">\"Alles, van de inrichting tot het licht en de muziek, was doordacht samengesteld. Ik vertrok ontspannen en verfrist \u2014 als een nieuw mens.\"<\/p>\n        <p class=\"testi-by\">Kinuthia<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"testi-card\">\n        <div class=\"testi-stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<\/div>\n        <p class=\"testi-quote\">\"Haar aanwezigheid en focus gedurende de hele sessie zijn buitengewoon. Je voelt je volledig verzorgd vanaf het eerste moment.\"<\/p>\n        <p class=\"testi-by\">Fern\u00e3o O.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section class=\"faq\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div class=\"label\">Vragen & antwoorden<\/div>\n    <h2 class=\"title\">Alles wat je moet weten<br><em>voor je boekt<\/em><\/h2>\n    <div class=\"faq-inner\">\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">Hoe krijg ik een prijs \/ offerte?<span>+<\/span><\/div><div class=\"faq-a\">Sessies worden geprijsd op basis van het gekozen type en de duur. Stuur een WhatsApp-bericht en Mari antwoordt met een persoonlijke offerte, alle details en beschikbare tijden \u2014 meestal snel.<\/div><\/div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">Waar vindt de sessie plaats?<span>+<\/span><\/div><div class=\"faq-a\">Alle sessies vinden plaats in Mari's priv\u00e9 studio in Amsterdam. Het exacte adres en de routebeschrijving worden gedeeld na bevestiging van de boeking.<\/div><\/div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">Is dit een seksuele dienst?<span>+<\/span><\/div><div class=\"faq-a\">Nee. Alle sessies zijn strikt therapeutisch. De focus ligt op fysieke verlichting, energetisch herstel en echt welzijn. De studio is professioneel en te allen tijde volledig respectvol.<\/div><\/div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">Wat moet ik dragen \/ meenemen?<span>+<\/span><\/div><div class=\"faq-a\">Draag comfortabele, makkelijk uit te trekken kleding. Kom indien mogelijk al gedoucht \u2014 er is ook een douche beschikbaar in de studio. Betaling via contant of pin.<\/div><\/div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-q\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">Hoe lang duurt een sessie?<span>+<\/span><\/div><div class=\"faq-a\">Sessies zijn beschikbaar in 60, 90 en 120 minuten. Mari raadt de beste duur aan op basis van je doelen wanneer je contact opneemt.<\/div><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section class=\"location\" id=\"location\">\n  <div class=\"location-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"label\">Bezoek ons<\/div>\n      <h2 class=\"title\">Vind onze <em>studio<\/em> in Amsterdam<\/h2>\n      <p class=\"location-address\">Brouwersgracht 270A<br>1013 HG Amsterdam<br>Nederland<\/p>\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/dir\/Massagem+Amsterdam+-Mari+Gomes,+Brouwersgracht+270A,+1013+HG+Amsterdam,+Pa\u00edses+Baixos\/Massagem+Amsterdam+-Mari+Gomes,+Brouwersgracht+270A,+1013+HG+Amsterdam,+Pa\u00edses+Baixos\/@37.0311168,-7.8446592,14z\/data=!3m1!4b1!4m13!4m12!1m5!1m1!1s0x47c6095d24b054c5:0x1f0bbf12412e2877!2m2!1d4.8849098!2d52.3828845!1m5!1m1!1s0x47c6095d24b054c5:0x1f0bbf12412e2877!2m2!1d4.8849098!2d52.3828845?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDYyNC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" class=\"btn-outline\" target=\"_blank\">Routebeschr